WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.929
QuotePlate connects your kitchen, purchasing decisions
and suppliers.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.286
Add your restaurant and delivery address.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:13.404
Sign up with a verified Google email.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:22.085
Type or paste dishes, use your phone, upload photos,
or use a permitted website.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:26.874
Review the ingredients, quantities and units.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.856
Then approve the menu for purchasing.

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:39.419
Paste your supplier contacts. Review the list, then
add them to your restaurant.

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:44.062
Check a supplier’s public website.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:47.858
Review the source, use a contact, then save.

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:55.805
Start with a shopping-list photo or text. No menu
needed.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:59.240
Check the rows, then add them to your draft.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:03.436
Choose suppliers and save.

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:11.952
Use WhatsApp, email, or copy the private link.

00:01:12.172 --> 00:01:13.325
You send the message.

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:20.299
Suppliers can quote on their phone. Choose a clear
price-list photo, or paste prices.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:23.662
Check the matched item and rate, then fill the quote.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:30.516
Use one item at a time if helpful. Review delivery and
the total, then send.

00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:37.547
Compare the four-hundred and four-hundred-forty rupee
offers.

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:42.469
Choose the suitable supplier and confirm.

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:48.518
Read an invoice photo or paste its text.

00:01:50.300 --> 00:01:52.497
Review and apply billed quantities and rates.

00:01:55.300 --> 00:01:58.734
Record nine kilos received, and forty rupees credit
owed.

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:06.051
Keep delivery follow-ups in view.

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:09.065
Share a private supplier workspace.

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:14.691
Suppliers confirm business details and delivery terms,
then review orders.

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:20.973
Search public listings for nearby supplier leads.

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:25.311
Plan portions, check stock, and see missing
ingredients.

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:30.997
Review supplier price ranges, spending and delivery
performance.

00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:35.421
Keep purchase history, and repeat orders as new
drafts.

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:38.619
Keep every purchase clear.

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:43.712
Start your first purchase with QuotePlate. Every
quote, accountable.
